<Text color="#475569FF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="→ 132 在本院范围内，但注意：有的机构把血小板参考值写成 100–300，有的写成 125–350 → 换医院复查前，先确认那张单子上的参考区间是哪一套。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="56" top="1096" width="302.0" height="31.24">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="22.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="看到箭头之后，按这张表做事" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="56" top="1130" width="1288" height="30">
<Container color="#0B1220FF" borderRadius="8.0" width="1288" height="30" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="70" top="1138" width="100.0" height="19.88">
<Text color="#FFFFFF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="你看到的现象" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="600" top="1138" width="100.0" height="19.88">
<Text color="#FFFFFF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="它实际意味着" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="960" top="1138" width="72.0" height="19.88">
<Text color="#FFFFFF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="该做什么" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="56" top="1166" width="1288" height="34">
